<title>USA: United Carolina Bancshares Q3 net slips.</title>
<headline>United Carolina Bancshares Q3 net slips.</headline>
<dateline>WHITEVILLE, N.C. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>UNITED CAROLINA BANCSHARES CORPORATION AND SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>			(In thousands except per share amounts)</p>
<p>			   Three Months Ended     Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			     Sept. 30,		   Sept. 30,</p>
<p>			   1996     1995	    1996	 1995</p>
<p>Net interest</p>
<p>  income		45,711   42,705	  132,128    125,122</p>
<p>Net income	   12,049   13,095	    35,229     34,831</p>
<p>Net income/shr	  .50	.55		1.46	 1.45</p>
<p>Avg shrs o/s	 24,237   24,124	    24,191     24,088</p>
<p>NOTE: The current quarter includes a charge of $489,000, or $0.02 per share, for the bank's special assessment by the Federal Deposit Insuarnce Corp to recapitalize the Savings Association Insurance Fund (SAIF).</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk  (212) 859-1610</p>
